| Torso tilt | 2.16° | **1.43°** |
| Pelvis tilt | 5.08° | **3.61°** |
| Lumbar travel | 5.42° | **3.68°** |
| Offset RMS | 0.0063 | **0.0053** |
| Head span | 5.03° | **0.46°** |
