Saturation 0 and both feet on the ground 1.0000 in both. Neck torque stayed 15 N·m,
`neckD` — 0.4: in the summaries `applied.useStablePd` is the only difference.

| Crouch, hold window 8–14 s | ordinary PD | **stable PD** |
|---|---|---|
| Head reversals in 6 s | 400 (33 Hz) | **5 (0.4 Hz)** |
| Head per physics step | 0.900° | **0.024°** |
