# Plants (30.08)

New layer. Builder `PlantTree` (not `UnityEngine.Tree`). Play scene `Tree`,
`treeCount = 1`. `SampleScene` and `World` keep `treeCount = 0`.

A tree is the same segmental box as a human limb: `HumanSegment` +
`HingeJoint2D`, size from collider, not `localScale`. Recursion `Grow`
from the parent tip: leader near the axis, side branch at `forkAngle`,
side alternates so CoM stays over the stump. Default `maxDepth = 3`,
cap 15 segments — one Human of bodies.

No muscles. Wood is `TreeSpring` (rest pose = grow pose) + `JointFriction`.
Stump is Static. Wind is `½ ρ v² S` on each dynamic segment, via
`TreeDriver` in `FixedUpdate`. Leaves are visual-only. `TreeRig.Static`
is the cheap grove (same shape, no hinges). Bark/leaf: `Art/bark`,
`Art/leaf` via `ArtLibrary`, same bake as clothing. Collider size unchanged.
